</div>

</div>

    </div>
          <div class="views-row">
           
<div class="node--embedded">
    <h3>
        <a href="/code/3/77/170" rel="bookmark"><span class="field field--name-title field--type-string field--label-hidden">3.77.170  Reports.</span>
</a>
    </h3>
    



<div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--label-hidden field--name-field-section-body field--type-text-long ck-content"><div class="field__item"><ol class="code-list"><li><span>The Ombudsman may from time to time and will annually report the Office of the Ombudsman’s activities to the Mayor, the City Administrator, Council or any of its committees, the public and, in the Ombudsman’s discretion, to agencies.</span></li></ol></div></div><div class="views-element-container">
<div class="mb-6 view view-eva view-city-code-list view-id-city_code_list view-display-id-eva_embedded_code_chapters js-view-dom-id-cffa54a1802572296a346c768d68802145eb3e991c899a0d16b88f1162d18075">
  
    

  
  

  
  
  

  
  

  
