  </div>
</div>

</div>

    </div>
          <div class="views-row">
           
<div class="node--embedded">
    <h3>
        <a href="/code/3/77/220" rel="bookmark"><span class="field field--name-title field--type-string field--label-hidden">3.77.220 Relationship to Other Laws.</span>
</a>
    </h3>
    



<div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--label-hidden field--name-field-section-body field--type-text-long ck-content"><div class="field__item"><ol class="code-list"><li><span>The provisions of this Chapter are in addition to, and do not in any manner limit or affect, any other provisions of law under which any remedy or right of appeal is provided for any person, or any procedure is provided for the inquiry into or investigation of any matter. The powers conferred on the Ombudsman may be exercised notwithstanding any provision of law to the effect that any administrative action will be final or unappealable.</span></li></ol></div></div><div class="views-element-container">
<div class="mb-6 view view-eva view-city-code-list view-id-city_code_list view-display-id-eva_embedded_code_chapters js-view-dom-id-7fdc66ca8e7515a255646a9ca891e93f959103e98ff0e142a8441d10013d5c29">
  
    

  
  

  
  
  

  
  

  
  </div>
</div>
<div class="views-element-container">
<div class="mb-6 view view-eva view-city-code-list view-id-city_code_list view-display-id-eva_embedded_code_sections js-view-dom-id-ace3d88b7286b310c72e0fe13c9b26f1d7ddc4ad0fe2838684daf9461d462fcb">
  
    

  
  

  
  
  

  
  

  
